    <item>
      <title>从软件开发到 AI 绘图 最后我居然联系到了美妆</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/from-software-development-to-ai-i-finally-think-of-makeup/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 17 Nov 2024 08:16:35 +0800</pubDate><author>crazyhl@163.com (M1racleHao)</author>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/from-software-development-to-ai-i-finally-think-of-makeup/</guid>
